\">\n\t\t\t<a href=\"http://messenger.yahoo.com/imvironments/view/doodle/\"><img src=\"http://l.yimg.com/a/i/mesg/insider/doodle_gallery.gif\" alt=\"\" title=\"\"></a>\n\t\t</div></div>\n\t</div>\n</div><div class=\"plugin\">\n\t<div class=\"info\">\n\t\t<h4><a href=\"http://messenger.yahoo.com/imvironments/view/footballkick/\">Football Kick</a></h4>\n\t\t<p class=\"description\">Think you've got a winning foot? Challenge your friend to a game of Football Kick to determine a champion. Use the arrow keys to adjust the direction of the ball, and then hold the… <a href=\"http://messenger.yahoo.com/imvironments/view/footballkick/\">More info</a></p>\n\t</div>\n\n\t<div class=\"preview\">\n\t\t<div class=\"showcase\"><div class=\"frame imagelink\">\n\t\t\t<a href=\"http://messenger.yahoo.com/imvironments/view/footballkick/\"><img src=\"http://l.yimg.com/a/i/mesg/imv/footballkick_gallery.jpg\" alt=\"\" title=\"\"></a>\n\t\t</div></div>\n\t</div>\n</div></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"secondary\">\n\t\t<div class=\"secondary_nav\">\n\t<h5>IMVironment Categories</h5>\n\t<div class=\"content\">\n\t\t<ul>\n\t\t<li><a href=\"http://messenger.yahoo.com/imvironments/category/animalsandnature/\">Animals and Nature</a></li><li><a href=\"http://messenger.yahoo.com/imvironments/category/beautyandfashion/\">Beauty and Fashion</a></li><li><a href=\"http://messenger.yahoo.com/imvironments/category/comicsandcharacters/\">Comics and Characters</a></li><li><a href=\"http://messenger.yahoo.com/imvironments/category/interactivefun/\">Interactive Fun</a></li><li><a href=\"http://messenger.yahoo.com/imvironments/category/loveandfriendship/\">Love and Friendship</a></li><li><a href=\"http://messenger.yahoo.com/imvironments/category/purple/\">Purple</a></li><li><a href=\"http://messenger.yahoo.com/imvironments/category/sportsandgames/\">Sports and Games</a></li><li><a href=\"http://messenger.yahoo.com/imvironments/category/yahootools/\">Yahoo! Tools</a></li>\t\t</ul>\n\t</div>\n\n